 -m twine` fails: No module named twine. twine is only in .github/release-requirements.txt.\n- `python -m build` (isolated, resolving pyproject's `hatchling>=1.27` to the newest hatchling) produced wheel and sdist with Metadata-Version 2.5. The release-pinned twine 6.2.0 rejects both: \"InvalidDistribution: '2.5' is not a valid metadata version\".\n- The release.yml path (fresh venv, `pip install --require-hashes --no-deps -r .github/release-requirements.txt`, hatchling 1.31.0, `python -m build --no-isolation`) produces Metadata-Version 2.4, and `twine check` PASSES both artifacts.\n\n## Impact\nA pre-push local packaging check gives a false failure on a correct tree, and the local artifact differs from what release.yml publishes. The release itself is unaffected.\n\n## Remediation options\nA make target that reproduces the release build (hash-locked venv + --no-isolation + twine check), or an upper bound on hatchling in [build-system].requires.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A documented local command reproduces release.yml's build and twine check, and passes on a correct tree.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"07b5-2e8e-caea-4bef","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Local 'python -m build && twine check' fails a correct release: isolated build emits Metadata-Version 2.5, and twine is absent from the dev venv","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c48acaa8-903f-4df8-b378-49975f2191ff","f123b1bc-41a3-45e6-a2b7-0a3696a831ea"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794259676628933002,"uuid":"1f4aff3f-5345-4ca3-ad83-cd0112c306a4"}